{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107691","id":2603259945,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bKpgp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107691","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107691.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107691.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107691","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107691/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107691/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107691/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4bbafc8d0e68ccf7bb60dc76ec8cae2fc77e0ec4","number":107691,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `MeshInstance3D::get_active_material()` error on empty mesh or empty surfaces","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105580\r\n\r\nA `MeshInstance3D` without a `Mesh` resource (or empty surfaces) has also empty surface material arrays.\r\n\r\nThe `get_active_material()` function tried to access those empty internal material arrays and did run into index errors.\r\n\r\nThe correct order for checking what material is active is:\r\n\r\n- Check if there is a general geometry material override on the inherited `GeometryInstance3D`.\r\n- Check if a `Mesh` even exists and if it has surfaces.\r\n- Check the surface material override slot on the rendering instance.\r\n- Check the surface material slot on the mesh resource.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"